{"4272360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trapped on the FlipSide", "steam_appid": 4272360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, Energize, Listen Up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb and spread energy around a mechanical megastructure. Assist trapped friends, stuck in their holographic prison. Uncover the past, the purpose and the truth about the OA-System, its founders and its hostages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seamless Brutalist Megastructure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an interconnected ecosystem of stone and metal, navigate and solve abstract challenges. Seamlessly go between areas and easily return to previous places with what is necessary to move forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Layers of Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find abilities that will allow for further exploration. Discover secrets, fueling the mystery through energized diorama. Accomplish what is needed to uncover and conquer the bosses, hidden deep within the stone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich Evolving Narrative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing favorites will bring you fortune. Follow the plan of one  character or balance the spread between all three. Their fate is in your hands, who will you lead to success and who will fall into obscurity? Will your choices differ once you see their effects?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, Energize, Listen Up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb and spread energy around a mechanical megastructure. Assist trapped friends, stuck in their holographic prison. Uncover the past, the purpose and the truth about the OA-System, its founders and its hostages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seamless Brutalist Megastructure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an interconnected ecosystem of stone and metal, navigate and solve abstract challenges. Seamlessly go between areas and easily return to previous places with what is necessary to move forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Layers of Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find abilities that will allow for further exploration. Discover secrets, fueling the mystery through energized diorama. Accomplish what is needed to uncover and conquer the bosses, hidden deep within the stone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich Evolving Narrative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing favorites will bring you fortune. Follow the plan of one  character or balance the spread between all three. Their fate is in your hands, who will you lead to success and who will fall into obscurity? Will your choices differ once you see their effects?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "In this Puzzle Platformer, follow the narrative of three explorers, kidnapped by a mechanical megastructure. Play as their assistant spherical robot in an effort to save them from this brutal place. By powering up the system, area by area, the secretive past and dark truth may make itself known.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272360/fa66ca521aad3309d8de01169ef5c4214e689649/header.jpg?t=1781412633", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272360/aff1c1749a58f20a610f1270d11bfb78cf5f0d23/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781412633", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272360/aff1c1749a58f20a610f1270d11bfb78cf5f0d23/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781412633", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3470 (4 * 3200) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 960 (4096 VRAM)<br></li><